{"2962320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Artificial Detective", "steam_appid": 2962320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person action-adventure where a robot detective uncovers the mystery behind humanity’s disappearance. From talent behind Love, Death &amp; Robots, DreamWorks, and Crytek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover what happened to humanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as AD 2846, a robot detective with fractured memories, in a decopunk metropolis maintained by mad robots. Together with DAWG, your loyal military robodog, and Mowgli, a human girl raised by machines, fight and hack your way through a city where crazy robots took over to uncover why humanity vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate, improvise, survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the multilayered districts of Conglomerate North, a crime-ridden metropolis seized by the malevolent Rise Corp. Use electromagnetic weapons, hack systems, weaponize the environment, or stay hidden and outsmart rogue robots. Search for clues, gather resources, and approach each encounter your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stronger as a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions are more than just sidekicks. They are your toolkit and your progression. Build trust, unlock abilities, craft and repair equipment, scan threats and open new ways to explore, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A city built for curiosity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between locations on a flying streetcar, uncover hidden routes, meet bizarre robots, and face bosses guarding the next piece of the mystery. Every district reveals more of the world, its rules, and the truth behind humanity’s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A witty story in a world gone wrong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cinematic adventure that blends action, companionship, and mystery in a striking Art Deco future. Artificial Detective is a witty, character-driven story about unlikely companionship and the future-of-humanity dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-adventure with sandbox encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, hack, sneak, or weaponize the environment (fire, electricity, magnets, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion-driven progression and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a flying streetcar across more than ten unique districts of the decopunk metropolis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story campaign with bosses, secrets, and flashbacks to the past of Artificial Detective</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE INVESTIGATION AND UNCOVER THE TRUTH TODAY! ADD ARTIFICIAL DETECTIVE TO YOUR WISHLIST.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person action-adventure where a robot detective uncovers the mystery behind humanity’s disappearance. From talent behind Love, Death &amp; Robots, DreamWorks, and Crytek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/2f641e812edaf5d8147ddf6603b9721a.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover what happened to humanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as AD 2846, a robot detective with fractured memories, in a decopunk metropolis maintained by mad robots. Together with DAWG, your loyal military robodog, and Mowgli, a human girl raised by machines, fight and hack your way through a city where crazy robots took over to uncover why humanity vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/80522b1c027ff42fcef65369b27b29f2.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate, improvise, survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the multilayered districts of Conglomerate North, a crime-ridden metropolis seized by the malevolent Rise Corp. Use electromagnetic weapons, hack systems, weaponize the environment, or stay hidden and outsmart rogue robots. Search for clues, gather resources, and approach each encounter your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/e429637cf6a959cec717e0e32538915d.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stronger as a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions are more than just sidekicks. They are your toolkit and your progression. Build trust, unlock abilities, craft and repair equipment, scan threats and open new ways to explore, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/8ba9069df7a744f4a6335946dc82ca3c.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A city built for curiosity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between locations on a flying streetcar, uncover hidden routes, meet bizarre robots, and face bosses guarding the next piece of the mystery. Every district reveals more of the world, its rules, and the truth behind humanity’s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/052e75a06589a7f305041193690a8804.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A witty story in a world gone wrong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cinematic adventure that blends action, companionship, and mystery in a striking Art Deco future. Artificial Detective is a witty, character-driven story about unlikely companionship and the future-of-humanity dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.poster.avif?t=1774549070\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.webm?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/extras/81d35b18b7f1a30629461d4fe08bb3d0.mp4?t=1774549070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-adventure with sandbox encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, hack, sneak, or weaponize the environment (fire, electricity, magnets, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion-driven progression and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a flying streetcar across more than ten unique districts of the decopunk metropolis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story campaign with bosses, secrets, and flashbacks to the past of Artificial Detective</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE INVESTIGATION AND UNCOVER THE TRUTH TODAY! ADD ARTIFICIAL DETECTIVE TO YOUR WISHLIST.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Artificial Detective is an action-adventure where you step into the shoes of a robodetective in a dystopian city overrun by rogue robots. Lead your underdog team of a military robodog and a human girl as you fight, hack, and outsmart your enemies to uncover why humans are gone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/fe8a83b8ad60400d0ad096cb02cbdb5df7bde63d/header.jpg?t=1774549070", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/0a4f388e936f64777a67107bb75c3a027f9e2430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774549070", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962320/0a4f388e936f64777a67107bb75c3a027f9e2430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774549070", "website": "https://artificialdetective.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7-6700 or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 90 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["VIVIX Inc."], "publishers": ["VIVIX Inc."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "descriptio